# VanillaDeluxe menu text
profile.comment=§4§lVanillaDeluxe 1.11.0 – Performance & Polish Update§r. Ray tracing level. §7Off§r uses vanilla lighting. §aLow§r adds ray traced light and shadows from torches. Both also use lighter shadows, reflections and volumetrics, for older graphics cards. §eMedium§r is the standard, with bounce light. §4High§r reaches further and uses the real colours of light sources and stained glass. §4§lUltra§r traces up to 24 bounces over up to 16 chunks.
profile.RT_OFF=§7Off
profile.RT_LOW=§aLow
profile.RT_MEDIUM=§eMedium
profile.RT_HIGH=§4High
profile.RT_ULTRA=§4§lUltra

