option.ICE_REFLECTIVITY=Ice Reflections
option.ICE_REFLECTIVITY.comment=Ice gets a glossy surface with screen-space reflections. When off, it only reflects a rough sky.
option.GLASS_REFLECTIONS=Glass Reflections
option.GLASS_REFLECTIONS.comment=Glass reflects its surroundings, most strongly at shallow angles. When off, glass has no reflections.

